      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Personal experience: A child yelled over my conversation for using 'the wrong gendered avatar' based on my voice. This could be avoided if I was hidden from all visitors/nuisances coming in and out of the instance. I'd rather not give up on public worlds because of few bad apples, but the damage has already been dealt when I learn to block them.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
