  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-07-29T10:59:50.247Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "We're currently able to hide other peoples' avatars based on groups, but add the option to flip it: YOUR avatar is hidden form certain groups.\nLike hiding avatar from certain ranks, but also checkboxes for groups ie.:\nFriends, Not Friends, All, in this instance, Always\nMaybe on an avatar basis, or in the safety menu with the other Hiding features. Also the option to select someone and hide *from them* specifically, like we can hide their avatar currently.\nThis would give users control with their nsfw/gore content in publics, and for example avoid nuisance/visitor ranks buzzing around an avatar. You could also spare others if you know you have an especially heavy avatar, or an animation etc, but still take pictures as you with your friends.",
